<!-- Base Text -->
<ntg.title.pharmacy_pill_calculator>Pharmacy Pill Calculator</ntg.title.pharmacy_pill_calculator> 
<ntg.pharmacy.description>\nThis page is capable if calculating possible results for your pills. 
\nNote: Medical Skill while fabricating has a chance to impact the quality of the pill's effects. Low medical skill can decrease pill potency; if you want to look for the best-case scenario, simply set the medical skill to 100.
\nAll Blood Packs have the same effect - you don't have to use 0-.
\nEach result is per-pill: this means generally pills are more efficient than their normal ingredients on their own.</ntg.pharmacy.description>

